(7410037, 1167681, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great expression, composition, and a tribute to the past. Reminds me of double exposures being done in college. The way the dark bottom left corner fades into the hair and reveals the face is just wonderful. The color and choice of lamp  creates a balance and intrigue I really enjoy. You deserve the babyface blue: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167384" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png"/></a></td>', 'Great expression, composition, and a tribute to the past. Reminds me of double exposures being done in college. The way the dark bottom left corner fades into the hair and reveals the face is just wonderful. The color and choice of lamp  creates a balance and intrigue I really enjoy. You deserve the babyface blue: ', '2015-10-15 10:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
